{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "719a90739747ccf6c2da9eea1c369476f6d6466ed40fd339945341a3eb925f24", "ja": "舞台に立つ理由", "zh": "站在舞台上的理由", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d5d2fba1a4e21f54fcfc5d355f0ed614e715227dce0378f28dc54a21e1f5a317", "ja": "ファンレターをきっかけに、表現すること\nそのものについて考えるようになったと話す\n歌織。それでもステージに立つ理由を、皆の\nせいにはしたくないと言う。息抜きの途中で\n環に会った歌織は、一緒に探検をする。", "zh": "歌织说，受到粉丝来信的契机，她开始思考表达本身这件事。  \n即便如此，她也不愿把自己站上舞台的理由归咎于大家。  \n在放松途中遇见环的歌织，和她一起展开了探险。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "48634ecfd0693a394ab2b592a207ab0262a00315caec4b4a629d15e22d9d500f", "ja": "（数日見ているけど、歌織さんの様子に\n変なところはない。ただ、少しだけ……）", "zh": "（观察了几天，歌织小姐的状态没有什么奇怪的地方。只是，稍微有一点……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1001_052kao", "source_sha256": "77c12c9a8bc8801e43d2aa59bcf9130a1eb3a6af7d7cdb937eb6f73b3e010470", "ja": "んー……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1cdc87d03932cd744aaabfdd204519b86e9e536bbedab0c912d4d7991c60fd46", "ja": "なんだか最近考え事が多いみたいですね、\n歌織さん。", "zh": "感觉你最近好像总是在思考什么呢，歌织小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "b363c5f5f937a6c705f73960d14eabcc9c05708760d65fd9ca9d0d2ddb4553a8", "ja": "えっ……？\nまぁ、私ったら。すみません。", "zh": "咦……？\n哎呀，我真是的。不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "dcbc4ab287a3b9d6dbe3185eb5ab11348675601241fc208c6a21615464c97060", "ja": "{$P$}さんには、\nすぐにバレてしまいますね。", "zh": "真是什么都瞒不过\n{$P$}先生呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ffa085f95aae1ebb41a1ada815a924ee4f6286dbf7bfe826c9cd88fef033d279", "ja": "もしかして、打ち合わせの時に読んでいた\nあの手紙の事ですか？", "zh": "难道说，是指碰头会的时候读的那封信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ead0ddd7088057fc8dd8fabd1f0843863e6fb986b8b5b7813fafcf756a45aae0", "ja": "その……難しい事ではあるんですが。全ての意見を\n真摯に受け止めるのは、無理というか……。", "zh": "那个……虽然这确实很难，但要认真听取所有意见，怎么说呢……实在办不到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "3c255ef8897b22ea3c053846bb47b66b458d86ab6d0f05a8f8a792daf3fe329b", "ja": "はい。お手紙自体は、実はそんなに気にして\nいないんです。ただ、考えるきっかけになったので。", "zh": "是的。其实我并不怎么在意信本身。只是，它让我有了思考的契机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "241f0eb27a56b9f51689957874fe880e1b503df0542b1368986cc7358bb8bb12", "ja": "考えるきっかけ？", "zh": "思考的契机？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "6e196b6e6d25475cb7c52891a235400e78a877ed6f733237d544b59504bd97ce", "ja": "ええ。歌やお芝居……もっと大きく言えば、\n表現すること、そのものについて……。", "zh": "嗯。关于歌曲和戏剧……再说得宽泛一点，\n关于“表达”本身……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "bf77ceb86cb11bbd79548afa498b10fa5616688184fb27518292b51d87fee7e8", "ja": "私たちの表現を、世の中の全ての人が\n好意的に受け取ってくれるわけではありません。", "zh": "并非世上所有人都会对我们的表达\n抱有好感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "32b6514a61c3b487868cd3a3f8d2340dadc50ec7887e81393ab9ba0d98be789f", "ja": "楽しむ人の影で、誰かが不快になっていたり……\n時には、否定されることだってあると思うんです。", "zh": "在享受的人背后，也可能有人因此感到不快……\n有时，我想也会遭到否定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "442b2d54bb50689ae72bff636246ad9257722426ad705eebf89786209ac0414d", "ja": "そうですね。表現を世に出すならば、\nそこから逃げる事はできません。", "zh": "是啊。如果要把表达呈现给世人，就无法逃避这些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "b4fb0465e86d4623bcb90c43d66bc0ca533f370e6f7c7321c99637d8767d5694", "ja": "それは当然で、私が立ち止まる理由には\nなりません。だけど……。", "zh": "那是当然的，也不会成为让我停下脚步的理由。可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "b94c4cdd89a6d562fbfd24ccb810a55321612db071203948a9337d8bca55b161", "ja": "それでも今回の公演に、舞台に立つのならば。\nせめて、私なりの答えを出したくて……。", "zh": "即便如此，既然要登上这次公演的舞台。\n至少，我也想给出属于自己的答案……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "708204437232037eddffe55765f69364579e785c2de70ff9770f2dc4c9462f9a", "ja": "歌織さんなりの、答えですか。", "zh": "这是歌织小姐自己的答案吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1016_052kao", "source_sha256": "86c420e6e63f4bcb6576f27e2c48de400b285e7e4d309f21ff6b6a4fa18aece5", "ja": "はい。劇場のみんなで繋いできた公演だから、\n舞台に立つ……そう言ってしまうと、その……。", "zh": "是的。这是属于我的答案。因为这是剧场的大家共同延续下来的公演，所以，要说是自己站上舞台……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "ef95336855257000ef369de07cef2b8ec05608413901ccdc3564db6ee5594986", "ja": "まるで、私がこのステージに立つ理由を、\nみんなのせいにしているような気がしてしまって。", "zh": "总觉得这样一来，就好像把我站上这个舞台的理由，都归咎于大家了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1018_052kao", "source_sha256": "e984feab586d8d1e71a3a8d3324734ab77498c8220d3b9f91ea8cc90c75a7e80", "ja": "なので……私自身が納得して、胸を張って言える。\nそんな言葉を探しているんです。", "zh": "所以……我正在寻找那样的话语：能让我自己信服，并且可以挺起胸膛说出口。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "113afa745c3d332dffaff592d5ef8e4273dcfc01dd171ca22caea4ab611077d8", "ja": "なるほど……。表現を生業にする以上、\n一度はぶつかることなのかもしれませんね。", "zh": "原来如此……既然以表达为生，或许总有一天会遇到这种难题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "f81fe27c60482987c53bd49c66c247e12ab4cb9c7661359622fe346db8059d89", "ja": "すみません。こんな、個人的な気持ちの\n話をしてしまって……。", "zh": "对不起，竟然说了这么多个人的想法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1021_p", "source_sha256": "40b7d08ef036365feef2e1da41a6a2382bcb298274c364a194b99998eb5dab1c", "ja": "とんでもない。いくらでも付き合います。\nけど、ずっと考え事をしていると疲れますよね。", "zh": "没这回事。无论聊多久我都奉陪。\n不过，一直思考也会很累吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1414d8f2ff1726d7557d0f0b012be21e4e27bc3f5025d61da4e6ca3ceb83d40a", "ja": "どうでしょう、歌織さん。\n少し、劇場の周りを散歩でもしませんか？", "zh": "怎么样，歌织？  \n要不要去剧场周围稍微散散步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "1bdc624020f14126e43f1bb94df4b0543cdca10da8b078e20db21ec042225f81", "ja": "こうして、外の空気を吸うのも大事ですよね。\n誘っていただいて、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "像这样呼吸一下外面的空气也很重要呢。\n谢谢您邀请我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "c9c48a45ec1d571a8db6031752d571d4d4b29857d2e6d4fa8cd708c9a6bebf42", "ja": "いえ、自分もちょうど休憩だったので。\n……あれ？　あそこにいるのは……。", "zh": "不是的，我也正好在休息。\n……咦？那边的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "aca0700fc6dc4606ee692d1ad189ada703d795b0468ec79463408ec957d9778f", "ja": "あっ、おやぶん！\nかおりー！", "zh": "啊，老大！\n歌织——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1026_052kao", "source_sha256": "8a379ad2b270357ddda439523e0af0048369008cc9992435a7e4ea0797415ebd", "ja": "こんにちは、環ちゃんもお散歩？\n……じゃなくて、探検かしら？", "zh": "你好，小环也在散步吗？\n……不对，是在探险吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "b59743abe932ff349b2fdcdd9f5feb9f3f6b0d43aa9ed1b037f725f27db2daba", "ja": "うん！　草むらとか木の影とか、\nいろんなところで虫探してた！", "zh": "嗯！我在草丛里、树影下之类的地方，到处找虫子呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "ed48468059d1b3e8515e4b7aa23452066d770910ee18f841bed8b6f3cf59a869", "ja": "この時期にか……。\n真冬に獲れる虫って、何がいるんだ？", "zh": "这个时节吗……？\n大冬天能抓到的虫，都有哪些啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "19c6e18ed07d2e4d768c977e88d37c80d4b20169705b0becb60c84a79d11a50b", "ja": "えっと、さっき、カマキリの卵見つけたんだ～！\n劇場に持って帰ろうかなって。くふふ♪", "zh": "那个，我刚才发现了螳螂卵～！\n我在想要不要带回剧场。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1030_052kao", "source_sha256": "0a61a1051622dbdfbf27a0a1776c1d6302c0d6e34fa457b9f1c77b500b62f184", "ja": "カマキリの卵……。", "zh": "螳螂卵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "1fbdb5eb545e388cf792133539741fa5e85313e62e553a44ea8d887efe9c5423", "ja": "いや、室内に持っていくと孵っちゃうから……\n別の探検場所はないかな、環隊長！", "zh": "不行，带进室内会孵出来的……\n没有别的探险地点了吗，环队长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "a6f11da5d73ea6edf057eebec2cfedaec375dcc5631fd28ddb8da1b7032a2b8e", "ja": "たいちょう！？\nおやぶん、たまきが隊長でいいの！？", "zh": "队长！？  \n老大，让环来当队长真的可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "6ce3627d03ddb349112f796af0b307b4fdd13e2e7987b25caeb44240ccfd8925", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ！\n俺達も少し探検したかったから、頼んだ！", "zh": "啊，当然了！\n我们也想稍微探险一下，所以就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1034_040tam", "source_sha256": "b47339f0622324b338f72b4c34f409a4744ad77f3077b252e20b54f9e7784e9c", "ja": "わかった！\nおやぶん、かおりも、たまきについてきて！", "zh": "明白了！\n老大、歌织，快跟上环吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
