{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1036_p", "source_sha256": "5a808421a75e7d9e5b84df38cfa9f8153e44e6e2fa382dfa57fce245fe906f9b", "ja": "まさか、劇場にあんな秘密の抜け道があるとは……\n普段動かさない筋肉が……いてて。", "zh": "真没想到，剧场里居然会有那种秘密通道……\n平时用不到的肌肉都……好痛痛痛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
