{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1038_p", "source_sha256": "6c59e7cec9eab48c98806ed19dd46203e5860db9a3038618b845b6ff262b6725", "ja": "ええ、まあ……。\nいい運動になりましたから。", "zh": "嗯，还好……锻炼得挺充分的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1039_040tam", "source_sha256": "0899408a0d5475b10f8fdfdf30e90eccddb6e39eb70dc29b26fb96b0b6a86e8f", "ja": "くふふ、楽しかったー♪　ねえねえ、かおり！\nこの後は、たまきに歌を教えて！", "zh": "嘿嘿，好开心啊♪ 喂喂，歌织！\n接下来教教环唱歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1040_052kao", "source_sha256": "22d30269499088d71e89156b8683db972d04a8839e2a607c10ffe451e2bc6c1e", "ja": "ふふ、環ちゃんは元気ね。\n私でよければ、もちろん！", "zh": "呵呵，环很有精神呢。\n如果你不嫌弃我的话，当然可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_02_1041_040tam", "source_sha256": "40d4bf18607edc365e0e149efde5d75d81cc41552a22b8fac57f521860dc3db8", "ja": "育とじゅりあも大丈夫かな……？\n劇場のみんなでやるんだから、いっしょがいいぞ～！", "zh": "育和朱莉娅也没问题吗……？毕竟是剧场的大家一起做，还是一起比较好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
